      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T00:47:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It it the latter.\n\n`GatherPackagingSpecs` returns the [transitive packaging specs](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/android/packaging.go;l\u003d411;drc\u003d5c35ee7707cf05a755d9209a0cfaa1aad0a1f68b;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d1). When visiting apexes in the module context of filesystem, it will return the installed files of apex deps as well.",
      "parentUuid": "6578fda8_dc51154c",
      "revId": "3175e0f5de1a82c91e7831dfcfdd657b7a3509a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
